Package: libvds0
Architecture: linux-any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: in-process RDP display server library
 libvds is the in-process remote display server (RDP) used by QEMU's -rdp
 option. It encodes the guest display with H.264 (openh264), RemoteFX or
 bitmaps and carries input, clipboard and audio.

Package: libvds-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: linux-any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libvds0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: in-process RDP display server library - development files
 libvds is the in-process remote display server (RDP) used by QEMU's -rdp
 option.
 .
 This package contains the header and the pkg-config file (vds-1) needed to
 build QEMU against libvds.
